gametitle=Ape Escape 2 (USA) [SLUS-20685]

// Quick Gadget Swap restored from the Japanese release (Saru! Get You! 2, SCPS-15025).
// The US build still contains the input handler, roulette update, HUD and close/assign code;
// only the "open quick select" branch of func 0x2B4AE8 (JP 0x2ADED0) was stripped.
// 0x2B4B10: bnez $s0 -> code cave; 0x2C6758..0x2C67C4: JP open-path (dead func reused as cave).

[Quick Gadget Swap (restored from JP)]
author=WillMidia (RE of SLUS-20685 vs SCPS-15025)
description=Tap the face button of the gadget you are holding again to open the quick-select roulette; keep tapping to cycle (unowned gadgets are skipped). Use the gadget (right stick) or press R3 to confirm (swaps buttons if needed); press another face button to leave.
